  "harness_note": "Executed via a standalone Java harness (javac/java, OpenJDK 27) that transliterates the block's core transformation logic with input_row/output_row replaced by plain method parameters/return values. No globalMap/context/cross-row static state is involved, so the transliteration is behavior-preserving. Source files: samples/talend_export_src jars_src (for the external-lib calls) + an ad hoc Harness*.java driver (not checked into this repo).",
  "cases": [
    {
      "case_id": 1,
      "description": "priority tag + order id + trailing-empty tags",
      "input": {
